    "detailed_description": "Chaos Storm: Strategy Edition is a magic style tower defense strategy game. You will be the leader of a specific camp, strengthen your power through constant battle, defend your strongholds, and constantly expand your territory, eventually becoming the ruler of the whole world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControlling the battle in real time, you can control the guards to shoot the attacking enemies remotely, control the hero to fight in close combat, manage a fearsome ground and air attack, or cast powerful spells to defeat an onslaught of enemies trying to capture your flag and destroy your castle, At last, win the battle!",
